<section class="section"><div class="container">
 <div class="section-heading"><span class="section-label">WHY CHOOSE US</span><h2>A Better Website Starts with <span class="blue">the Right Partner.</span></h2><p>We combine practical development with a business-first approach.</p></div>
 <div class="why-grid">
